id: hac-97on
title: Implement normalized typed service action contracts
description: "Implement current REST and WebSocket service action requests, response capability planning, normalized output envelopes, target selectors, response modes, input files, strict validation, read-only enforcement, exhaustive docs/tests, and release-safe delivery."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[8]: api,cli,coverage,docs,service-actions,testing,type-safety,websocket
