comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T21:19:03.813Z",codex-root,Implementation scope selected after all-status PM and GitHub duplicate search; media discovery and trigger subscriptions are explicitly excluded as already delivered.
  "2026-07-27T21:38:02.767Z",codex-root,Official 2026 REST and WebSocket contracts are implemented with separate wire types and one stable CLI envelope. Latest local server acceptance verified a required-response weather action without retaining private identifiers or payloads.
  "2026-07-27T21:41:23.246Z",codex-root,"PM integrity exposed a stale history-drift cache in pm-cli 2026.7.27. Detailed duplicate search found no match; upstream issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/779 records the reproducible false-negative strict gate and runtime-cache recovery."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T21:19:03.813Z",codex-root,"Live acceptance may use ephemeral entity IDs but durable evidence records only booleans, counts, versions, shapes, and redacted classifications."
  "2026-07-27T21:38:03.650Z",codex-root,TOON was upgraded from 2.x to current 4.1.0 in this delivery because it is the default programmatic format. Existing Dependabot PR 73 only proposed 4.0.0 and is therefore superseded by this newer tested resolution.
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T21:19:03.813Z",codex-root,REST and WebSocket action results require a discriminated normalization layer; one guessed interface cannot safely describe both.
  "2026-07-27T21:38:04.408Z",codex-root,"Commander boolean env integration treats variable presence as truthy. Removing env binding from the bare boolean option lets the config loader remain the single strict parser, so false and 0 correctly disable read-only mode."
