close_reason: "Typed REST and WebSocket service actions, normalized output, target/response planning, latest TOON, documentation, setup/live acceptance, strict PM integrity, security and exact 100 percent coverage are implementation-complete for reviewed delivery under plan hac-ahkf."
body: "Preserve hassio call-service domain service compatibility while adding agent-native planning and transport controls. Correct the REST result union, add WebSocket action execution using official target/service_data/return_response fields, normalize both transports, fix explicit boolean environment parsing, extend schema/capability documentation, and verify current live behavior with identifiers suppressed."
